Charlene Estrada, editor; Chris Johnson, Callan Bentley, Karla Panchuk, Matt Affolter, Karen Layou, Shelley Jaye, Russ Kohrs, Paul Inkenbrandt, Cam Mosher, Brian Ricketts, and contributors. Introduction to Historical Geology, Maricopa Open Digital Press edition. [Complete book and chapter-level attributions](https://open.maricopa.edu/fallglg102/).

Read the complete book as the historical companion, including its sequence, fossil, rock, tectonic, time, and Earth-history material. Preserve the particular edition and chapter contributors; this is an attributed adaptation, not a claim that every chapter has the same author or date. Compare historical interpretations with the evidence and later primary work.

